Proje adı: SysTrack
Şirket: Beyz System
Hedef: Raspberry Pi 5 üzerinde hafif, modern, ajan gerektirmeyen ağ izleme (ICMP/TCP/HTTP), web tabanlı admin panel.
Kısıtlar: React YOK, Bootstrap YOK. Frontend: HTMX + Alpine + Tailwind(CDN) + Chart.js(CDN), minimal JS. Backend: Go + Gin + MySQL (InnoDB). Docker opsiyonel, default: systemd servis.

========================================
1) Dizin Yerleşimi
========================================
/cmd/systrack/main.go                 # server entry
/internal/config/config.go            # .env yükleme
/internal/db/mysql.go                 # MySQL bağlantı + sqlc/gorm DEĞİL, sqlx öner
/internal/db/migrations/              # golang-migrate SQL dosyaları
/internal/auth/jwt.go                 # JWT üret/Doğrula
/internal/auth/password.go            # bcrypt
/internal/mw/authmw.go                # JWT middleware, RBAC guard

/internal/ws/hub.go                   # WebSocket hub (reconnect dostu)
/
internal/scheduler/runner.go         # fping batch runner, pacing/staggering
/internal/scheduler/state.go         # ardışık fail/success sayaçları
/internal/alerts/manager.go          # OPEN/CLOSE/RECOVERY, throttle
/internal/handlers/api_*.go          # /api routes (users, targets, pings, alerts, settings, healthz)
internal/handlers/admin_*.go         # /admin HTML partialları (htmx)
internal/logs/logger.go              # structured log
/static/admin/                       # frontend (CDN tabanlı)
  index.html
  js/app.js          # router (hash), toast, modal, ws init, theme toggle
  js/ws.js           # websocket helper (exponential backoff)
  js/toast.js        # Toast.show({type,msg})
  js/modal.js        # portal modal open/close + ESC/backdrop
  js/helpers.js      # qs, debounce, dom utils
  css/custom.css
/Makefile
/.env.example
/README.md
/scripts/seed_admin.go (veya küçük CLI)
/systemd/systrack.service

========================================
2) .env & Config
========================================
.env keys:
APP_BIND=0.0.0.0
APP_PORT=8080
DB_DSN=user:pass@tcp(localhost:3306)/systrack?parseTime=true&charset=utf8mb4&collation=utf8mb4_unicode_ci
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@systrack.local
ADMIN_PASSWORD=ChangeMeNow!
JWT_SECRET=change_this_secret
PING_BATCH_INTERVAL_SEC=30
PING_TIMEOUT_MS=1000
FAIL_OPEN=3
SUCCESS_CLOSE=2
RAW_RETENTION_HOURS=48

config.go: .env oku, type-safe struct; eksik varsa fatal logla.

========================================
3) Veritabanı Şeması (MySQL InnoDB)
========================================
/internal/db/migrations/0001_init.sql
-- users
CREATE TABLE users (
  id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
  email VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,
  pass_hash VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
  role ENUM('admin','user','viewer') NOT NULL DEFAULT 'admin',
  limits_json JSON NULL,
  created_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

-- targets
CREATE TABLE targets (
  id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
  name VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,
  address VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
  type ENUM('icmp','tcp','http') NOT NULL DEFAULT 'icmp',
  port INT NULL,
  path VARCHAR(255) NULL,
  interval_sec INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 30,
  timeout_ms INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1000,
  enabled TINYINT(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,
  tags VARCHAR(255) NULL,
  created_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  updated_at DATETIME NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  INDEX idx_targets_enabled_type (enabled, type)
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

-- pings_raw (kısa sakla)
CREATE TABLE pings_raw (
  id BIGINT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
  target_id INT NOT NULL,
  ts_ms BIGINT NOT NULL,
  ok TINYINT(1) NOT NULL,
  rtt_ms INT NULL,
  FOREIGN KEY (target_id) REFERENCES targets(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  INDEX idx_pings_target_ts (target_id, ts_ms),
  INDEX idx_pings_ts (ts_ms)
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

-- alerts
CREATE TABLE alerts (
  id BIGINT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
  target_id INT NOT NULL,
  level ENUM('minor','major') NOT NULL,
  opened_at DATETIME NOT NULL,
  closed_at DATETIME NULL,
  message VARCHAR(255) NULL,
  status ENUM('open','closed') NOT NULL DEFAULT 'open',
  FOREIGN KEY (target_id) REFERENCES targets(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  INDEX idx_alerts_target_status (target_id, status),
  INDEX idx_alerts_opened (opened_at)
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

-- settings (opsiyonel key-value)
CREATE TABLE settings (
  k VARCHAR(64) PRIMARY KEY,
  v TEXT NOT NULL
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

========================================
4) Backend (Go + Gin)
========================================
- Server: Gin, CORS açık (iç ağ), gzip.
- Middleware: authmw (JWT), rbac (role guard).
- Auth:
  POST /api/auth/login {email, password} → {token}
  GET  /api/me → user info
- Users:
  GET    /api/users
  POST   /api/users
  PUT    /api/users/:id
  DELETE /api/users/:id
- Targets:
  GET    /api/targets
  POST   /api/targets
  PUT    /api/targets/:id
  DELETE /api/targets/:id
  POST   /api/targets/:id/ping-now
- Pings:
  GET /api/pings/:target_id?since_ms=&limit=
- Alerts:
  GET /api/alerts?status=&level=&q=&page=
  POST /api/alerts/:id/close
- Settings:
  GET/POST /api/settings (Telegram/SMTP/Webhook tokenları vs.)
- Health:
  GET /healthz (SELECT 1 + fping -v check)

- Admin HTML (HTMX partial):
  GET /admin/dashboard
  GET /admin/users
  GET /admin/targets
  GET /admin/alerts
  GET /admin/settings
  GET /admin/partials/target_history?id=
  GET /admin/partials/user_form?id=
  GET /admin/partials/target_form?id=

- WebSocket:
  GET /ws
  Mesaj tipleri (JSON): {type:"status_update", targetId, status}, {type:"alert_open"|"alert_close", ...}

- Seed Admin:
  `go run ./scripts/seed_admin.go` → .env’den admin user ekler (varsa skip)

- Logging:
  JSON line logs (level, ts, msg, ctx); request id middleware.

========================================
5) Scheduler & Ping (fping batch)
========================================
- /internal/scheduler/runner.go:
  - interval_sec’e göre hedefleri gruplandır.
  - fping ile batch: tek komutta listeyi pingle (pacing; `-c 1 -t <timeout>`).
  - Çıktıyı parse et; sonuçları tek writer goroutine ile pings_raw’a bulk insert.
  - Ardışık fail/success sayaçları (in-memory harita); FAIL_OPEN ve SUCCESS_CLOSE eşikleri ile alert OPEN/CLOSE üret.
  - Throttle: aynı hedef için kısa sürede tekrar OPEN spam’ini engelle.

- Staggering: farklı grupların start’ını kaydır (hepsi aynı saniyede çalışmasın).
- Retention job: RAW_RETENTION_HOURS dolan veriyi gecelik purge et.

========================================
6) Frontend (HTMX + Alpine + Tailwind CDN)
========================================
/static/admin/index.html:
- CDN’ler: Tailwind, HTMX, Alpine, Chart.js
- Layout: Sidebar (Dashboard, Users, Targets, Alerts, Settings) + Topbar (search, theme toggle, profile) + Main (#view-root).
- İlk yüklemede:
  <main id="view-root" hx-get="/admin/dashboard" hx-trigger="load" hx-target="#view-root" hx-swap="innerHTML"></main>
- Portal kökleri: #modal-root, #toast-root

/ static/admin/js/app.js:
- Hash router: data-route="/admin/users" linkleri → HTMX ile partial yüklesin.
- Toast/Modal init; theme (dark/light) localStorage.
- WebSocket init (ws.js), gelen event’lere göre DOM badge güncelle.

/ static/admin/js/modal.js:
- body altına modal container oluştur; open(html)/close(); ESC/backdrop kapatma.

/ static/admin/js/toast.js:
- Toast.show({type, title, msg, timeout}) → sağ üstte küçük kart.

/admin/users partial (serverdan HTML):
- Üst form: q (search), role (select)
- Tablo (thead, tbody#users-tbody)
- “Create User” butonu: hx-get="/admin/partials/user_form" → #modal-root içine; modal.open()
- Form submit: hx-post="/api/users" → success: listeyi hx-get ile yenile + Toast.success

/admin/targets:
- Arama + tag filtre; tablo: Name, Address, Type, Interval, Timeout, Status, Actions
- “History” butonu: hx-get="/admin/partials/target_history?id=.." → modal
- “Ping now” butonu: hx-post="/api/targets/:id/ping-now" → satırda mini feedback + Toast

/admin/alerts:
- Filtre (level, status, time range); tablo; “Close” action

/admin/dashboard:
- Kısa kartlar: Total/Online/Offline/Unknown
- Son 5 alert listesi
- Küçük Chart.js örneği (son 1 saat avg RTT)

========================================
7) Güvenlik
========================================
- JWT auth (HS256, secret .env).
- Parolalar bcrypt.
- Role guard: admin tam yetki; user kısıtlı; viewer read-only.
- Rate-limit (basit token bucket) login ve mutasyon endpointlerine.
- Loglarda hassas veri yok.

========================================
8) Systemd Servis (Docker’sız default)
========================================
/systemd/systrack.service:
[Unit]
Description=SysTrack (Beyz System) — Network Monitor
After=network-online.target
[Service]
User=pi
WorkingDirectory=/opt/systrack
EnvironmentFile=/opt/systrack/.env
ExecStart=/opt/systrack/systrack
Restart=always
RestartSec=5
[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target

Kurulum (özet):
- sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y mariadb-server fping golang
- MySQL:
  CREATE DATABASE systrack CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
  CREATE USER 'systrack'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'StrongPass!';
  GRANT ALL ON systrack.* TO 'systrack'@'localhost'; FLUSH PRIVILEGES;
- .env doldur; `go build -o systrack ./cmd/systrack`
- golang-migrate ile `migrate -path internal/db/migrations -database "mysql://systrack:StrongPass!@tcp(localhost:3306)/systrack" up`
- `go run ./scripts/seed_admin.go`
- systemd enable/start

========================================
9) Kabul Kriterleri
========================================
- 1000+ hedef / 30s interval ile stabil: ping sonuçları işleniyor, pings_raw büyüyor, retention purge çalışıyor.
- Dashboard/Users/Targets/Alerts/Settings partial’ları HTMX ile hızlı yükleniyor.
- Modallar görünür (portal + z-index), ESC/backdrop kapama çalışır.
- WebSocket ile status/alert live güncellenir (badge/row).
- /healthz DB + fping ok → 200.
- Reboot sonrası systemd servis otomatik kalkar, admin login çalışır.

========================================
10) Notlar
========================================
- React/Bootstrap kullanılmayacak.
- JS minimum tutulacak, CDN ile yükle; bundle yok.
- Chart.js sadece gerekli grafiklerde kullanılacak.
- Kod temizliği: lint, gofmt; log’lar JSON tek satır.
- Geliştirici deneyimi: Makefile hedefleri:
  make build / make run / make seed / make migrate-up / make migrate-down
  